    <string name="tvclient_bitstream_dts">Pass through DTS and TrueHD</string>
    <string name="tvclient_bitstream_dts_desc">Automatic: if the TV or AV receiver accepts DTS/TrueHD, the audio is passed through; otherwise Quallenkino decodes it itself (5.1, or stereo if the output only has stereo) – the server is not involved. Checked at every playback start. Off: the server converts the audio to Dolby Digital 5.1.</string>
